# Curiouser Franchise Operating System (CFOS)

## Overview

Curiouser Franchise Operating System (CFOS) is a purpose-built platform designed to standardise, scale, and safeguard early years education franchises. It combines training, operations, quality control, and parent engagement into a single system—enabling consistent delivery and measurable outcomes across all locations.

CFOS is not just management software. It is an operational infrastructure that ensures every franchisee can replicate the same quality, experience, and educational impact.

---

## 🚀 Core Features

### Training Academy

* Structured onboarding for franchisees and teachers
* Modular video-based learning
* Built-in assessments and certification
* Progress tracking and compliance monitoring

### SOP Execution System

* Step-by-step class delivery checklists
* Embedded media guidance (images/videos)
* Materials and preparation instructions
* Execution tracking with proof uploads

### Parent Experience & Reporting

* Capture and organise photos/videos of children
* Development tracking aligned with EYFS framework
* Structured progress reports (Observation, Assessment, Next Steps)
* Parent-facing timeline and insights

### Quality Control

* Remote class monitoring via media uploads
* HQ review and scoring system
* Feedback and continuous improvement loop

### Revenue Visibility Layer

* Student enrolment tracking
* Attendance-based data capture
* Structured records to improve financial transparency

---

## 🧩 System Modules

* Dashboard (multi-location overview)
* Training Academy
* SOP & Operations
* Staff & Rota Management
* Media & Parent App
* Reporting System
* Quality Control
* Revenue Tracking

---

## 👤 User Roles

* **HQ Admin** – Full visibility across all locations
* **Franchisee** – Manages store operations and staff
* **Teacher** – Executes lessons and completes training
* **Parent** – Views child development and reports

---

## 🏗️ Tech Stack

* **Frontend:** Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
* **Backend:** Supabase (Auth, Database, Storage)
* **State Management:** React Query
* **Storage:** Cloud-based media storage (Supabase Storage / AWS S3)

---

## 🔐 Key Principles

* **Standardisation First** – Reduce operational variability
* **Training-Led Execution** – Users must learn before they operate
* **Data-Driven Control** – Capture truth at source, not via reports
* **Mobile-First Design** – Built for real-world classroom usage

---

## 📈 Roadmap

### Phase 1 (MVP)

* Training Academy
* SOP Execution
* Media Upload
* Basic Reporting

### Phase 2

* Advanced analytics dashboard
* CRM and enrolment tracking
* Enhanced parent experience

### Phase 3

* AI-assisted reporting (EYFS insights)
* Automated quality scoring
* Predictive performance metrics

---

## 🎯 Vision

To become the foundational infrastructure for scalable education brands—where quality is systemised, measurable, and independent of individual operators.

---

## 💡 Summary

CFOS transforms franchise operations from people-dependent to system-driven.

It enables:

* Consistent teaching quality
* Scalable operations
* Stronger parent trust
* Transparent performance tracking

**In short: it is a system for replicating excellence.*
